{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13221260","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13221260","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1322126001:0":{"text":"근처에 아무도 없어요... 두 수도사는 대성당 안에 있을지도 몰라요.","source_cn":"附近没有人……那两位修士可能在教堂里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFCAFFF2666B6B00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1322126002:0":{"text":"그렇다면 제 무덤을 통해서 대성당으로 들어가죠. 아무도 보지 않도록 조심하세요.","source_cn":"那么还是从我的墓穴进入大教堂吧。小心点，别被人看到了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E8CA5BB3171A51F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卡列琳娜":{"text":"캐롤라이나","source":"卡列琳娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":2}}